性，眼睛深邃，鼻梁很高，和欧美人差不多。嘴唇有些薄，皮肤呈小麦色。果然，穿越定律之一，穿越必然会遇到帅哥，太好了！打量帅哥的同时，莫忆儿不忘道谢，只不过，男人听不懂罢了。对着莫忆儿露出一个友好的笑容，直接转身扛起野猪带着出现的小孩子走人。“喂！你别走啊！”看到他们离开，莫忆儿一阵心慌。这里是什么地方她不知道，语言也不通，她至少要活下去才行吧！男人回过头，眉头皱了皱，低头叽里呱啦的和小孩子说了几句什么，小孩子也叽里呱啦的讲着什么，然后还指了指莫忆儿，又指了指天上！两个人再看莫忆儿的时候，目光中充满了复杂。之后，男人扛着比他大上好几倍的野猪，小孩子扛起比他大上两倍的莫忆儿开始狂奔。莫忆儿在嗰得她发疼的小肩膀上惊慌得大叫：“什么情况，你们要做什么？”一大一小两个人只顾着狂奔，根本没人管莫忆儿的大叫。莫忆儿只能心惊胆战的人十来岁的孩子扛着自己，心道这个世界太疯狂了，男人能扛野猪，小孩子能扛女人，自己不会进入了一个玄幻的世界吧？被人扛在肩头的滋味并不好受，莫忆儿只觉胃部翻滚，强忍住要吐的感觉。这两个人的奔跑速度快得让莫忆儿咋舌，虽说不比骏马奔驰，可也抵得上自行车的速度了，半个小时左右，他们终于停了下来，并且大声的吼叫：“啊……唔唔唔！啊……唔唔唔！”很快，便有人回应着他们，声音很是欢呼雀跃。小孩子把莫忆儿放了下来，一双乌溜溜的眼睛看着她，有些好奇，但更多的探究。莫忆儿此刻打量起面前的景物，是一座山，山不是很高，上面是光秃秃的大石头，偶有几棵歪脖子小树和杂草，一大群人从山脚下的山洞奔了出来，脸上都洋溢着明媚的笑容，迎接着狩猎回来的男人。而且，他们身上都和男人一样，围着皮毛，不同的是，皮毛的品种不同而已！更让莫忆儿震惊的是，其中的几个女人竟然也**着上身，尺寸非常可观的胸部随着奔跑而颤动，这让勉强只有B罩杯的莫忆儿情何以堪啊？她下意识的看了眼自己的胸部，被睡裙遮住，和没有没什么两样。“！@#！@￥@#%￥……%&%……”人们跑了过来，一阵阵听不懂的叽里咕噜谈话声响起，莫忆儿直觉脑子有些当机，情况似乎太出乎她的意料之外了。他们一边说，一边看向莫忆儿，很明显，他们应该是在讨论莫忆儿的事情，眼中都出现了疑惑、懵懂、好奇等神色，但莫忆儿清楚的看到，里面没有厌恶！莫忆儿此刻明白了一件事，这些人穿兽皮，住山洞，似乎是……原始人！这个认知让莫忆儿心中掀起了惊涛骇浪，神马皇后王妃、神马富家千金地主婆都离她远去，只剩下一堆光**上半身，下半身围着兽皮的原始人在她眼前晃来晃去。苍天啊！你是在玩我吗？莫忆儿浑浑噩噩的，跟着男人进了山洞，里面已经有女人开始烤制食物，阵阵的肉香把莫忆儿拉回了现实。山洞很大，足矣容纳所有的族人，还有的女人在处理男人打回来的野猪，动作迅速而熟练，血腥气混合着肉香，复杂的味道很奇怪。山洞深处坐着几位年迈的长者，男人走到他们身边，和他们说着什么，而他们的目光直盯着莫忆儿，让她头皮有些发麻。叽里呱啦一阵子，这几位长者看莫忆儿的目光变得炙热起来，随后叫来扛着莫忆儿回来的小孩子，又是一阵叽里呱啦，最后围坐成一团小声的嘀咕起来，像是怕被莫忆儿听到一样。这样持续了好一会儿，他们齐齐的对莫忆儿露出友好的笑容。莫忆儿没有多想，只以为是男人在介绍着自己，而自己似乎也被这些人接受了。肉已经考好，由男人分给山洞里的所有族人，莫忆儿也被分到了一份，她也没客气，吃了男人分给她的烤肉，人是铁饭是钢啊！然后，用几个小时的时间消化了现实，明白了自己的处境，并且决定要坚强的活下去。未来的路她知道会很难走，不过穿越人士不都是这样？历尽千辛万苦，最终得到了自己想要的生活!她莫忆儿从来就不是个杞人忧天的人，俗话说的好，生活就像强/奸，不能反抗，就享受吧！而能被这群人接受，已经是万幸了。虽然一开始和她想象的相差甚远，不过她莫忆儿是打不死的小强，一定可以努力得到自己想要的，一定！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/sifuzhengchong-mengguaifujunyangchengji/2.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 2 Communication is too difficult (slightly modified) \"Hello! (The third tone of the word \"hao\".) hi, holle, Ohahayo, Savadika, Yachudie...\" Mo Yier babbled and searched for various foreign languages ​​​​that appeared in her mind. Of course, many of them have uneven pronunciation. However, the man was still confused and didn't understand anything. \"!@#!@￥@#%￥...%&%...\" What kind of place is this? The two stood on two trees and chatted loudly for several minutes. Finally, it was determined that communication was incompetent. Mo Yi'er scratched her ear-length hair in despair. The man had become impatient and yelled loudly not far away, but the content was still unclear. However, a teenage child ran over soon. The man threw the bloody wild boar in front of the child, jumped up on the tree where Mo Yi'er was, and looked at Mo Yi'er with confused and confused eyes. Mo Yi'er's heart moved. She couldn't understand the language, so she solved it with actions. She pointed to herself, then to the tree. The man tilted his head and thought for two seconds, then picked her up like a chicken and slid down the tree. \"Wow, I'm down, great!\" Mo Yi'er shouted excitedly. The man smiled, showing his white teeth, as if he was happy that he had guessed the thoughts of the person in front of him. Only then did Mo Yi'er realize that the man wearing leopard-print skin was very good-looking. His hair was long and draped over his shoulders. It seemed that it had not been combed for a long time and was a bit messy. He is very tall, over 185cm tall. Mo Yi'er, who is 168cm tall, looks much petite in front of him. His facial features are very wild, with deep eyes and a high nose bridge, similar to those of Europeans and Americans. The lips are somewhat thin and the skin is wheat-colored. Sure enough, one of the laws of time travel is that you will definitely meet a handsome guy when you travel through time. That’s great! While sizing up the handsome man, Mo Yi'er didn't forget to thank him, but the man couldn't understand. He showed a friendly smile to Mo Yi'er, turned around, picked up the wild boar and left with the child who appeared. \"Hey! Don't leave!\" Seeing them leaving, Mo Yi'er felt flustered. She doesn’t know what kind of place this is, and she doesn’t understand the language. She must at least survive! The man turned back, frowned, lowered his head and chattered a few words to the child. The child also chattered something, and then pointed at Mo Yi'er, and then pointed at the sky! When the two of them looked at Mo Yi'er again, their eyes were full of complexity. Afterwards, the man carried a wild boar that was several times bigger than him, and the child picked up Mo Yi'er, who was twice as big as him, and started running wildly. Mo Yi'er yelled in panic on her little shoulder that was aching: \"What's going on? What are you going to do?\" The two people, one big and one small, just ran around, and no one cared about Mo Yi'er's shouting. Mo Yi'er could only feel terrified that a teenage boy was carrying her. She thought that this world was too crazy. A man could carry a wild boar and a child could carry a woman. Wouldn't he have entered a fantasy world? The feeling of being carried on someone's shoulders was not pleasant. Mo Yi'er felt her stomach churn and tried to hold back the feeling of vomiting. The running speed of these two people was so fast that Mo Yi'er was stunned. Although it was not as fast as a horse, it was still comparable to the speed of a bicycle. After about half an hour, they finally stopped and shouted loudly: \"Ah... uh uh! Ah... uh uh!\" Soon, someone responded to them, and their voices were very cheering. The child put Mo Yi'er down and looked at her with a pair of dark eyes, a little curious, but more inquisitive. Mo Yi'er looked at the scenery in front of her at this moment. It was a mountain. The mountain was not very high. There were big bare rocks on it, with a few small trees and weeds. A large group of people ran out of the cave at the foot of the mountain, with bright smiles on their faces, welcoming the man who had returned from hunting. Moreover, they are all covered in fur like men, but the difference is that the fur is of different types! What shocked Mo Yi'er even more was that several of the women were also topless, and their very sizable breasts trembled as they ran. How could this make Mo Yi'er, who barely had a B cup, feel so embarrassed? She subconsciously glanced at her breasts, which were covered by her nightgown and looked like nothing. \"!@#!@￥@#%￥...%&%...\" People ran over, and bursts of incomprehensible chattering sounded. Mo Yi'er felt that her brain was a little confused. The situation seemed to be too unexpected for her. While they were talking, they looked at Mo Yi'er. It was obvious that they were discussing Mo Yi'er's affairs. There were doubts, confusion, and curiosity in their eyes, but Mo Yi'er could clearly see that there was no disgust in them! Mo Yi'er understood one thing at this moment. These people wore animal skins and lived in caves. They seemed to be... primitive people! This realization made Mo Yi'er feel a storm in her heart. The Queen and Princess of Shenma and the landlady of the wealthy family of Shenma all left her, leaving only a bunch of primitive people with bare upper bodies and animal skins surrounding their lower bodies dangling in front of her eyes. Oh my God! Are you playing with me? Mo Yi'er was confused and followed the man into the cave, where a woman was already baking food. The smell of meat brought Mo Yi'er back to reality. The cave is large enough to accommodate all the tribesmen. There are also women handling the wild boars that the men have brought back. They move quickly and skillfully. The smell of blood is mixed with the aroma of meat, and the complex taste is very strange. There were several elderly people sitting deep in the cave. The man walked up to them and said something to them, but their eyes were fixed on Mo Yi'er, which made her scalp feel numb. After chattering for a while, the elders looked at Mo Yi'er with hot eyes. Then they called the children who were carrying Mo Yi'er back, and started chattering again. Finally, they sat in a group and murmured quietly, as if they were afraid that Mo Yi'er would hear them.", "title_en": "Chapter 2"}